                                                "sense_id": "ccd2fcff-6946-32c4-8ca1-cc0e67eedd0e",
                                                "text": "[T]he yong L. Roger Mortimer, […] hauing corrupted his Keepers, or (as ſome others vvrite) hauing potioned them vvith a ſleepy drinke, eſcaped out of the Tovver of London, getting ouer clearely vvithout any empeachment into France."
                                            }
